=== Notes on bounds ===
The geometric Picard rank of V' can be lower-bounded by
the Shioda-Tate computation for any elliptic fibration:
  rho >= 2 + sum(m_v - 1) + MW_rank
V' has 3 face fibrations pi_d, pi_e, pi_f.
Generic rank of pi_d over Q(q) is 0 (from PARI/GP verification
in PICK-1-K3-TATE-ATTACK.md).
Bad fibers of pi_d: q in {0, infinity, +/- 1, +/- i}.

Computational lower bound from sample data (PICK-1):
  rho_geom(V') >= 6 (from p=7 trace data).

Tate conjecture (unconditional, Madapusi Pera 2015):
  rho_geom(V') = -ord_{s=1} L_2(s, V').
This is computable in principle but requires the full L-function.
